{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the sixth, seventh, eighth, and ninth basketball games of the season, a player scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points, respectively. Her points-per-game average was higher after nine games than it was after the first five games. If her average after ten games was greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, what is the least number of points she could have scored in the tenth game?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b938c87f1e2d7751f9d41c910988c6300bc001bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 26\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 27\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 28\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 29\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the scores for games <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/9782dd7447f84ce6adcf7945b86038e379c618f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$68$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />.  The average in these four games is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/268b9cde05ac9e642adcfcd628f878022b5358c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{68}{4} = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The total points in all ten games is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d54f6c306f1873d80a3004fb897073d828f3e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\cdot 18 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus, it must be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/9/4494573536421c07aee1148e569a97189de6a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$181$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>There are at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6ca54e09241bdca9c7605b9ab28bcf658c05d42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$181 - 68 = 113$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" /> points in the other six games:  games <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/d/8edc124c7f7a2d3729f66545564dea7041aee003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and game <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Games <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/d/8edc124c7f7a2d3729f66545564dea7041aee003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> must have an average of less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus we cannot put more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8bdbf2e825b809efdb30de7c58cd31d1df970e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 + 17 + 17 + 17 + 17 = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"224\" height=\"15\" /> points in those five games.\n</p><p>Thus, the tenth game must have at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77bbc338dba096772a96fa7d749baacf0f47eea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$113 - 84 = 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> points, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AHSM